{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://dimhour/venue-card.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://dimhour/venue-card.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get venue menus"},"description":"The menus Dim Hour holds for one venue, with the source and date of each. status is verified (menus read from the venue's own site, with sections and prices), link_only (a menu link from the catalog that nobody has verified), no_link, or unavailable. A link_only answer proves nothing about what the menu says. Each menu carries verified_at and a freshness state; past 90 days it is stale, and with no date it is unknown, never fresh. completeness says whether every menu this venue is expected to have is verified; requirements_unknown means nobody has recorded which menus to expect. At most 300 menu items are returned per call; `truncated` counts the rest. Prices and dishes change: confirm with the venue before relying on them.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"city":{"description":"City name or key","type":"string"},"id":{"description":"Venue id from search_venues","type":"integer"},"type":{"description":"Only this menu type, e.g. dinner, brunch, cocktails, wine","type":"string"}},"required":["city","id"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_venue_menus","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"type":"string"},"applicability":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["applicable","not_applicable","unknown"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"city":{"type":"string"},"city_name":{"type":"string"},"completeness":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["complete","partial","unavailable","requirements_unknown","not_applicable"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"fresh_complete":{"type":"boolean"},"id":{"type":"number"},"link":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"status":{"const":"catalog_l